# State

This phase: `lib/mock-data.ts` is the only data source. Session is `DEV_ROLE` + `getDevUser()`. Import them. Do not put session in React Context.

UI state (`search`, chips, FAQ expand, composer text, optimistic messages) = `useState` on the screen or feature component that owns it.

Optimistic send: append a local `Message` (`status: 'sending'` → `'sent'`). Do not mutate exported mock arrays; overlay in component state.

Forbidden until a later phase: Zustand, Redux, Jotai, global message Context, TanStack Query, `fetch` to a missing API, fake JWT, SecureStore, AsyncStorage as a database.

```tsx
// BAD
void fetch('/api/messages')
setMessages(CONVERSATIONS) // mutate module fixtures

// GOOD
const [messages, setMessages] = useState(initial)
setMessages((prev) => [...prev, optimistic])
```
